		<ol outputclass="callout" id="e00414">
			<li>
				<p>Power tailgate open/close button</p>
			</li>
		</ol>
		<section>
			<p>Press the power tailgate open/close button for 1 second. The tailgate opens or closes with a warning sound.</p>
			<p>While the tailgate is opening or closing, press the button to stop tailgate operation.</p>
			<p>If the smart key is not within operating range (approximately 10 m) from the vehicle, tailgate operation will stop with a warning sound for 5 seconds.</p>
		</section>
	</conbody>
